          "analysis": "The history queries department-level PercentSalaryHike and analyzes stock-option distributions and attrition. The final report includes no-stock-option prevalence and exposed-group attrition for R&D and Sales. Although salary-hike findings are not developed in the report, both required fields are investigated in the supplied evidence.",
