theses based on titles and tags rather than inspected footage. Anticipation of impact (+1 of -1 to +1): The candidate explains plausible mechanismsâuseful material may encourage saving, recognizable social situations may encourage sharingâand identifies how to evaluate their expected effects. The baseline mentions a reachâengagement trade-off, but its claims of exponential growth and initial engagement driving later sharing lack temporal evidence. The candidate provides more credible directional expectations without promising outcomes.",
